        "joint_chain_and_reach": {
          "status": "supported",
          "reason": "Bent elbows beside ribs lead through visible forearms/wrists to palms under the chin. Fingers can fan laterally without covering the open eye; unilateral wink and small relaxed smile are compatible.",
