            "the heels of both palms lightly touch the underside of her chin",
            "her fingers fan outward beneath both cheeks like petals",
            "Standing clear of the workbench"
          ]
        },
        "visibility_and_projection": {
          "status": "supported",
          "reason": "Frontal eye-level full body crop exposes face, hands, wrists, foot support and heel gap in one frame. The bench is behind her and cannot mask the lower legs. Selective background defocus retains face-and-hand plane detail.",
          "prompt_evidence": [
